ebp","name":"Low-Light Vision","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.LowLightVision]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"low-light-vision","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688842182460,"modifiedTime":1688842182460,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.fFu2sZz4KB01fVRc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"SVTXLkBOM3xtSVsk"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Eternal Flame","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>During creation a magical fire is lit inside a lantern leshy's head. This fire creates a bright light in a 15-foot radius. When a lantern leshy is destroyed, the piece of coal used to create this flame can be used as a piece of shining ammunition.</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"TokenLight","value":{"animation":{"intensity":4,"speed":1,"type":"torch"},"bright":15,"color":"#f59842","alpha":0.2,"shadows":0.2}}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["light","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"bhdd1U7oPw3Pj5cB","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688842198797,"modifiedTime":1689574080176,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Withering Burst","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>When a lantern leshy is destroyed, it explodes in a blast of necromantic energy. Due to its origin, this energy only affects plants, doing @Damage[1d10[void]] damage to each plant creature in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:30] with a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:15|basic:true] save. This burst causes plants in the area to rot, creating a disgusting miasma that lingers in the air for 1 minute. Any creature that breathes must attempt a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:15] save any time it enters or ends its turn in the area while the miasma lasts.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is temporarily immune to the miasma for 1 day.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected this turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Sickened]{Sickened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Sickened]{Sickened 2}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["poison","void"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":true,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"PCqIYCTbH7GmkVcX","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688842331469,"modifiedTime":1691261013344,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Head Toss","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The lantern leshy can remove its head and toss it to attack a foe. It makes a head Strike against a foe; this ability is the only way it can make a head Strike. Whether the Strike hits or misses, any creature within 20 feet of either the lantern leshy or the Strike's target must attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:18] save or be @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Frightened]{Frightened 1} (@Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Frightened]{Frightened 2} on a critical failure). The lantern leshy's head does not return after being thrown until it retrieves and reattaches it. It is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} until then, though it always precisely senses its own head. Picking up and reattaching the head requires a single Interact action by the lantern leshy, which it can do as long as the head is within its reach.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["emotion","fear","mental"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"h1qv2OSBNWEh2D6H","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688842463611,"modifiedTime":1688842522597,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Spooky Decorations","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The lantern leshy collapses into a pile of sticks and withered leaves with its illuminated head sitting on top. Creatures who come across the lantern leshy in this form must succeed a @Check[type:perception|dc:resolve(@actor.skills.deception.dc)] check against its Deception DC to recognize that it is not simply a decoration. This lasts until it uses this action again to regain its original form.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","occult","polymorph"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"cHQhWAsseAELzyxa","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688842464108,"modifiedTime":1691713751897,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Claw","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["agile","finesse"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"KDsqSrl6KLzkh6e2":{"damage":"1d6+3","damageType":"slashing","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":9},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"UNheJyVRsHx6DbWX","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVers